# Reins of the Pack Kodo from Okamache at the Durotar Supply and Logistics camp.
# The reins cost 6,000 Merchant's Favor, earned from crate hand-ins at the camps.
# Sources: Forever's world data, Okamache's vendor row (build 70124): extended
# cost 11042 = 6,000 Merchant's Favor (client ItemExtendedCost, currency 3402),
# PlayerCondition 163220 "Requires Durotar Supply and Logistics - Exalted"
# (client); Forever client 1.60.1.70532 via wago.tools (ItemSparse 262766: level
# 60; MountCapability: Riding 150, any race). Merchant's Favor is a currency
# Polestar cannot count. The Supply Factions Reputation guide has the road to
# Exalted.

step Durotar Supply and Logistics
  tip The camp stands just outside the west gate of the Crossroads in the Barrens. Okamache sells the Pack Kodo only once you are Exalted with Durotar Supply and Logistics, and it costs 6,000 Merchant's Favor. Crates pay only Favor (about 15 a crate return); the reputation comes from Craftsman's Writs and the one-time Shipping Label, so follow the Supply Factions Reputation guide and keep 6,000 Favor aside.
  goto 49.5,29.0 "Durotar Supply and Logistics camp"
  rep "Durotar Supply and Logistics" Exalted

step Pack Kodo
  tip The reins need level 60 and Journeyman Riding to ride (Forever client); you can buy them earlier.
  vendor 256400 "Okamache" @49.6,28.8
  buy 262766 "Reins of the Pack Kodo" npc 256400 -- 6,000 Merchant's Favor
